(Ragfather Employee Handbook) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 1: Remote Work Policy) Tj T*
(Employees may work remotely up to three days per week with manager approval.) Tj T*
(All remote work requests must be submitted through the HR portal at least 48 hours in advance.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 2: Vacation Policy) Tj T*
(Full-time employees accrue 15 days of paid vacation per year, increasing to 20 days after three years of service.) Tj T*
(Unused vacation days may be carried over up to a maximum of 5 days into the following year.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Section 3: Expense Reimbursement) Tj T*
(Employees traveling for business may be reimbursed for reasonable expenses including airfare, lodging, and meals.) Tj T*
(All expense reports must be submitted within 30 days of the trip with itemized receipts.) Tj T*
